Fiber isolation contract
  ActiveSupport::IsolatedExecutionState (the mechanism every axn key rides)
    is shared across fibers under the default :thread (characterizes why a fiber host must opt into :fiber)
    is isolated per fiber when the host sets isolation_level = :fiber (axn's guarantee)
  axn's nesting stack
    stays isolated per fiber when the host sets isolation_level = :fiber (axn's guarantee)
    is shared across fibers under the default :thread (characterizes why a fiber host must opt into :fiber)

